    text: "Affected southbound trips:\r\n11:40 am from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n1:55 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n4:10 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n6:25 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n\nAffected northbound trips:\r\n12:54 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n3:09 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n5:24 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n7:39 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11"
